Did the fantastic speed leave you dizzy?{VAR BE01}
My beloved Pokémon will be the next one
to make your head spin!{VAR BE01}

My, oh my...
You have a sweet fighting style.{VAR BE01}
I mean, you're a great Trainer!
Excuse me, I...uh... Oh, here!{VAR BE00}
I want you to have this!{VAR BE01}

If you have four Badges, including this
Bolt Badge, Pokémon up to Lv. 50,{VAR BE00}
including traded Pokémon, will obey you.{VAR BE01}
Also, here's this move I like.
Feel free to use it, um, if you want to.{VAR BE01}

Volt Switch lets the Pokémon switch with
a different Pokémon after attacking.{VAR BE01}
Of course, if you don't have another
Pokémon in your party, you can't switch.{VAR BE01}

You're going to Driftveil City next?{VAR BE01}
Of course. There is a Pokémon Gym there,
after all. Oh...{VAR BE01}
I bet you won't be able to get there.
You know what?{VAR BE01}
I'll fix it so you can cross.
Wait for me on Route 5.

Elesa: I think the real me is the one who
battles with Pokémon as a Gym Leader.{VAR BE01}
A model's job is to make someone else's
vision look like a reality.{VAR BE00}
It's interesting, but it's not easy...

When you ride a roller coaster, the
speed can make you dizzy.{VAR BE01}
I'm going to make your head spin with
a Pokémon battle that's just as intense!{VAR BE01}

Your way of battling...
It's elegant! You've got style!{VAR BE00}
Even compared to Ms. Elesa!{VAR BE01}

Your Nimbasa Gym challenge is finally
nearing its finale.{VAR BE01}
But if you don't beat me,
you won't get to meet Ms. Elesa.{VAR BE01}

I'm also a Pokémon Trainer who was
toughened up by Ms. Elesa.{VAR BE01}
I'll show you power and style befitting
this Gym.{VAR BE01}

If you maintain your calm and don't get
flustered by this Gym's gimmicks,{VAR BE00}
you'll be able to defeat Ms. Elesa...{VAR BE00}
and any other Trainer, as well!

{VAR 0100 0000} pressed the switch.{VAR BE01}
The roller coaster's path
has been changed!

How about it? I can see you're surprised!{VAR BE01}
Would you ever have guessed that
this Gym is a roller coaster?{VAR BE01}
OK, let me fill you in...
And take this, too!{VAR BE01}

In this roller coaster Gym, the first
step is to get in the car.{VAR BE01}
Next comes the platform!
There, you can change{VAR BE00}
where the coaster is going!{VAR BE01}
Sometimes you continue by riding
the cars of opponents you defeat.{VAR BE00}
That's how you aim for the Gym Leader!{VAR BE01}
By the way, Electric-type Pokémon don't
do well against Ground-type moves...

Elesa uses sparkling bright
Electric-type attacks!{VAR BE01}
But the combination of you and your
Pokémon was even more impressive!{VAR BE01}
It was... It was...
an emotional roller coaster!

